{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04585","headline":"五君咏五首 魏齐公元忠 · 张说","name":"五君咏五首 魏齐公元忠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"齐公生人表，逈天闻鹤唳。\n清论早揣摩，玄心晚超诣。\n入相廊庙静，出军沙漠霁。\n见深吕禄忧，举後陈平计。\n甘心除君恶，足以报先帝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}